But the PYEC is nevertheless rather attractive in vanilla.

At least that's what I remember from a lot of postings "if neutral
wish for the PYEC". Uncursed charging is rather useful so you don't
have to burn your magic markers and scrolls on simple chargeable items
like wands.

> Mirror, for example, now provides reflection when carried for Knights,
> but only when wielded for others.  The Eye became an amulet of power,
> rather than an amulet of ESP, and the amulet of power itself grants
> different scales of bonus for wizards compared to non-wizards.

These are good changes but doesn't this also increase the incentive to
wish for Quest artifacts?

And Quest artifacts are the only artifacts that have effects when
carried. This lets them still stand out even in SporkHack.


In reality ;-) when wishing for a Quest artifact one would expect that
the Quest nemesis and/or Quest leader would go looking for the thief.

